<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - June 17.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - June 17.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Tuesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- Mozambican Prime Minister Pascoal Mocumbi told a Lisbon conference of businessmen from Portuguese-speaking countries that the free circulation of goods, capital and people within the Lusophone community should be a short-term goal.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
